# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# The short trajectories of #795 (D422; D417,
# Section 8, S4a): the list of units under `rigid_units = "ON"`, with its writer,
# against the general path in double precision, for both integrators, NVE
# and NPT, under #795's declared bounds (the positions, the velocities at the
# step projected onto the constraints, and the volume of the units within 3
# times the largest difference of 5 general mixed runs from the double one,
# recorded in Inputs/segments_trajectory_bounds.json, or 1e-5 of the scale;
# Inputs/segments_trajectory.py), on three waters of OPC and of TIP3P. Each
# case passed 10 of 10 runs at the head of the PR. The NPT baselines were
# recorded again (5 runs) after mixed precision began to round the step cell
# to binary32 at each coupling (D[box-f32-exact]): with the old ones TIP3P
# LEAPFROG NPT failed 10 of 10 runs at step 90 (projected v 6.18e-05 against
# 5.89e-05) and passed 10 of 10 on main; with the new ones each NPT case
# passed 10 of 10 runs on an RTX 4090.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py OPC VELOCITY_VERLET NVE %S/Inputs %t/1 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="OPC VELOCITY_VERLET NVE"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py OPC VELOCITY_VERLET NPT %S/Inputs %t/2 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="OPC VELOCITY_VERLET NPT"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py OPC LEAPFROG NVE %S/Inputs %t/3 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="OPC LEAPFROG NVE"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py OPC LEAPFROG NPT %S/Inputs %t/4 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="OPC LEAPFROG NPT"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py TIP3P VELOCITY_VERLET NVE %S/Inputs %t/5 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="TIP3P VELOCITY_VERLET NVE"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py TIP3P VELOCITY_VERLET NPT %S/Inputs %t/6 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="TIP3P VELOCITY_VERLET NPT"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py TIP3P LEAPFROG NVE %S/Inputs %t/7 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="TIP3P LEAPFROG NVE"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_trajectory.py TIP3P LEAPFROG NPT %S/Inputs %t/8 | FileCheck %s -DCASE="TIP3P LEAPFROG NPT"
# CHECK: [[CASE]]: 10 samples of 100 steps within the declared bounds
